    "UnitCoverage": {
      "description": "INTERFACE_CONTRACT.md \u00a72.4a. One record per LayoutUnit the block produced,\nin the engine's own unit order. The mechanism decides PER UNIT (SPEC \u00a72.6: the\npay-stub box is one block of eight units with different fates), while the only\ngranularity previously on the wire was the block -- so every criterion about\ndrawn text was unverifiable at block granularity.\n\nDELIBERATELY ABSENT: any field naming the size the engine DREW. The report says\nWHICH units were drawn and WHERE; the DELIVERED PDF says at what size. A field\nread back from the engine's own report would be asserting intent, not observing\noutput (`rendered-not-asserted`), and would silently blind SPEC \u00a73 AC 1, 2 and\n33. A future round that adds `drawn_size` \"for convenience\" destroys them.\n\nNO TEXT, NO KEY MATERIAL: geometry, an opaque style token and vocabulary\nmembers only.",
      "properties": {
        "attempt": {
          "title": "Attempt",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "origin_x": {
          "title": "Origin X",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "origin_y": {
          "title": "Origin Y",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "fitted",
            "skipped"
          ],
          "title": "Outcome",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "empty_block",
                "page_extract_error",
                "engine_error",
                "provider_rate_limit",
                "provider_error",
                "translation_protocol",
                "masking_incomplete",
                "no_room_for_translation"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "reason_detail": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Reason Detail"
        },
        "reason_lead": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Reason Lead"
        },
        "reason_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Reason Message"
        },
        "source_rects": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/SourceRect"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Source Rects",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "source_size": {
          "title": "Source Size",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "style_key": {
          "title": "Style Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "unit_id": {
          "title": "Unit Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "warnings": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/WarningRecord"
          },
          "title": "Warnings",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "unit_id",
